# NOTE: do not add "extension" here.
#
# These patterns follow .gitignore rules, so a name without a slash matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth. A bare "extension" line silently took
# app/admin/extension, app/api/admin/extension and app/api/extension out of the
# deployment along with the extension source — the page and both endpoints
# answered 404 in production while existing in the repo.
#
# The source folder has to ship anyway: /api/admin/extension/download reads it
# at runtime (see outputFileTracingIncludes in next.config.mjs).
